  "description": "A high-performance .NET 8 library for creating pixel-perfect PDFs from HTML and URLs using a managed Chromium browser pool. Supports headers, footers, watermarks, encryption, metadata, cookies, custom JavaScript, lazy loading, and more.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
